Character art notice

The MIT license above covers this repository. Starting with v0.4.0 this
repository and its release builds contain no character images, videos or
reaction stickers. The default face and app icons are drawn from code in
desktop/src/default-face.js and are covered by the MIT license. The names of
the built-in characters refer to Chiikawa (ちいかわ, © Nagano / chiikawa
committee); all rights to the original characters belong to their respective
owners. Images that users add to their own installation stay on their own
computer and are not part of this repository.

Third-party code vendored in desktop/renderer/vendor/ keeps its own license;
see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
